<title>USA: Nutrition For Life sets initial dividend.</title>
<headline>Nutrition For Life sets initial dividend.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nutrition For Life International Inc said Monday it would pay its first quarterly cash dividend, $0.02 per share,  on October 15, record September 30.</p>
<p>The company said it was able to pay the dividend due to increased sales and net income for the third quarter ended June 30.</p>
